---
source: crates/zaun/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Show or hide the in-game overlay in the running Zaun (bind it to a key in your compositor, e.g. Shift+F1)

Usage: zaun overlay [OPTIONS] [ACTION]

Arguments:
  [ACTION]  What to do [default: toggle] [possible values: toggle, open, close]

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help (see more with '--help')
